      "content": "talking about it just makes me feel worse because then i have to watch her pretend she's okay when she's clearly exhausted. i just keep thinking... if i wasn't here, she could finally go back to being herself. she could travel, she could have her freedom back. it feels like the only way i could actually help her now is to just stop being a problem for her.",
